[4.550000000000001,"o","Plan: 50 total planned requests (50 measured + 0 warm-up) across 5 experiment arms; minimum schedule time 500ms\r\nConfiguration: method=GET timeout=30s rate=100.00/s requests=10 warmups=0 concurrency=[1 2]\r\nRunning baseline...\r\nRunning connection comparison...\r\nRunning concurrency stages...\r\nSloth diagnosis\r\nRules: 1.0.0\r\nPlan: 50 measured + 0 warm-up requests (50 total)\r\n\r\nExperiment summary:\r\n  baseline\r\n    samples=10  p50=32.4ms  p95=33.0ms  p99=33.3ms  errors=0\r\n    offered=31.29/s  achieved=31.29/s  actual concurrency=1.00\r\n  fresh connection\r\n    samples=10  p50=33.0ms  p95=33.3ms  p99=33.4ms  errors=0\r\n    offered=15.27/s  achieved=15.27/s  actual concurrency=0.50\r\n  reused connection\r\n    samples=10  p50=32.6ms  p95=32.9ms  p99=33.0ms  errors=0\r\n    offered=15.27/s  achieved=15.27/s  actual concurrency=0.50\r\n  concurrency-1\r\n    samples=10  p50=32.4ms  p95=33.2ms  p99=33.5ms  errors=0\r\n    offered=30.92/s  achieved=30.92/s  actual concurrency=1.00\r\n  concurrency-2\r\n    samples=10  p50=62.5ms  p95=63.0ms  p99=63.3ms  errors=0\r\n    offered=30.83/s  achieved=30.83/s  actual concurrency=1.83\r\n\r\nFindings:\r\n  INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE - The available experiments do not support a stronger diagnosis\r\n    Observation: Diagnosis was inconclusive for 1 evidence limitation(s).\r\n    Confidence: low (evidence quality, not probability)\r\n    Severity: info\r\n    Recommendation: Repeat with safely separated offered rates that produce a\r\n                    measurable achieved-load change.\r\n    Evidence:\r\n      limitation_count=1 count\r\n      - concurrency stages did not produce a meaningful achieved-load change\r\n\r\nLimitations:\r\n  - concurrency stages did not produce a meaningful achieved-load change\r\n\r\nNext steps:\r\n  - Repeat with safely separated offered rates that produce a measurable\r\n    achieved-load change.\r\n"]
